/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040Novel\040Multi\055Thread\040Parallel\040Constraint\040Propagation\040Scheme)
/Author (Zhe\040Li\054\040Zhezhou\040Yu\054\040Peng\040Wu\054\040Jianan\040Chen\054\040Zhanshan\040Li)
/Subject (Constraint\040Programming\040\050CP\051\040is\040an\040efficient\040technique\040for\040solving\040combinatorial\040\050optimization\051\040problems\056\040In\040modern\040constraint\040solver\054\040a\040CP\040Model\040is\040defined\040over\040reversible\040variables\040that\040take\040values\040in\040domains\040and\040propagators\040which\040filter\040the\040domains\040of\040the\040variables\056\040Constraint\040propagation\040scheme\040schedules\040the\040propagators\056\040A\040reasonable\040constraint\040propagation\040algorithm\040can\040improve\040the\040efficiency\040of\040solving\040CP\040problems\056\040In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040propose\040two\040efficient\040parallel\040propagation\040schemes\040based\040on\040multi\055thread\040technique\040for\040table\040constraint\056\040First\054\040we\040give\040the\040formal\040definition\040of\040the\040parallel\040consistency\040and\040prove\040that\040the\040parallel\040propagation\040scheme\040is\040equivalent\040to\040the\040classic\040serial\040propagation\040scheme\056\040Then\054\040we\040propose\040two\040parallel\040propagation\040schemes\072\040static\040submission\040and\040dynamic\040submission\054\040which\040exploit\040work\040stealing\040thread\040pool\040and\040atomic\040operations\040to\040parallelize\040the\040classic\040propagation\040of\040table\040constraint\056\040Finally\054\040extensive\040experiments\040on\040various\040types\040of\040problems\040show\040that\040the\040two\040parallel\040schemes\040outperform\040their\040original\040serial\040version\040on\040a\040large\040number\040of\040instances\056\040The\040results\040demonstrate\040the\040competitiveness\040of\040parallel\040propagation\040algorithms\040on\040solving\040extensional\040constraints\056)
/Keywords (01\040Nov\0402019\054\040IEEE\040Access\054\040Constraint\040programming\054\040Local\040consistency\054\040Constraint\040satisfaction\040problem\054\040Thread\040pool\054\040Work\040stealing\054\040Jilin\040University\054\040Chinese\040Academy\040of\040Sciences)
